PTX LU+cas.sys+diff-cluster
"Two relaxed .sys atom.cas on one global location: can both read the initial value (a lost update)?"
{
x=0;
P0:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                | P1@cta 1,cluster 1,gpu 0                ;
 atom.relaxed.sys.global.cas r0, x, 0, 1 | atom.relaxed.sys.global.cas r1, x, 0, 1 ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 0 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
